    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96565" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στερεό-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make firm</i> or <i>solid</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς πόδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					4.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γῆν ἐπὶ τῶν ὑδάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ps.</u>
					135(136).6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν οὐρανόν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Is.</u>
				45.12
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				1.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				735b2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>strengthen</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					3.16
				</span></i>
			; <i>confirm</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Si.</u>
					3.2
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be made strong</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.8.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				3.7
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>to be firmly established, confirmed</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				2.1
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				15.57
			</span></i>.</div>
